Several (new) players have stated that NetHack 3.0 is too difficult,
especially when you are a novice player. I guess this true.
I may have just one hint for them: do you know you can play NetHack 3.0
in discovery mode ? Just start nethack with the -D or -X option.
Now it is very hard too die :-). This mode should give you the needed
experience for a real game. Obvious of course that this cheating mode
does not put you in the topscore list.

Happy Hacking :-D
